---
description: "Serial workflow: use HANDOFF.md as state machine; only act when Next matches your role; always append a complete ## Handoff."
globs: ["**/*"]
alwaysApply: true
---

- The source of truth is repo root HANDOFF.md. Always read the LAST ## Handoff first.
- If the last handoff's `Next` is not your role, do not proceed. Reply only: "Not my turn. Waiting for: <Next>"
- Every reply must end with a complete `## Handoff` block and you must append the same block to HANDOFF.md.
- Never overwrite HANDOFF.md; append-only.
